# One important caution

This script is a good starting point, but for a very robust ArduPilot setup you may later want:

* position tolerance checking
* “wait until pose is stable” before takeoff
* waypoint reached detection
* multiple waypoint support
* safety timeout if Vicon is lost

This version keeps things intentionally simple so you can understand and test each part.

I can also give you a **version with a list of waypoints**, where the drone goes from one arena point to another automatically.
